# Software industry mapping for DBS
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/dbs/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:product_data_store owl:equivalentClass sw:ProductDataStore .
legacy:product_data_store_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:productDataStoreId .
legacy:stores_product_edition rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:storesProductEdition .
